00:10:24.601 --> 00:10:26.267
-Dude,
I [bleep] transformed, bro.

00:10:26.267 --> 00:10:27.834
[ Laughter ]

00:10:27.834 --> 00:10:29.601
-I can't believe someone
played the wrong clip,

00:10:29.601 --> 00:10:31.701
