-That's the right clip!

00:10:31.701 --> 00:10:33.400
-I'm gonna yell at them.
They played the wrong clip.

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:35.033
I'm so --
That's embarrassing.

00:10:35.033 --> 00:10:36.901
This is Bradley's movie,
"Maestro."

00:10:36.901 --> 00:10:39.167
He worked hard on it,
and you play that clip?

00:10:39.167 --> 00:10:41.634
I'm sorry. I apologize.
-That's -- That's okay.

00:10:41.634 --> 00:10:43.400
-I really --
Who are we talking to?

00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:45.267
-He's up there.
-Why are you up there?

00:10:45.267 --> 00:10:47.801
-Why can't you come down here
