00:10:47.801 --> 00:10:49.868
He likes it up there.
He loves heights.

00:10:49.868 --> 00:10:50.934
[ Laughter ]

00:10:50.934 --> 00:10:52.567
You ever see "Free Solo"?
-Yeah.

00:10:52.567 --> 00:10:54.634
-That's what he's into.
He's into that.

00:10:54.634 --> 00:10:57.334
So that's -- Now I really want
to show the real clip.

00:10:57.334 --> 00:10:58.634
-Okay.
-I apologize for that.

00:10:58.634 --> 00:11:00.100
This is Bradley Cooper
